{
 "brief": "Settlers have carried out approximately 3,000 attacks across the West Bank since the beginning of 2025, the Ma'an news agency reported. The assaults have targeted Palestinian communities and their property throughout the territory over the past weeks.\n\nThe attacks span multiple locations across the occupied West Bank, affecting Palestinian residents in areas including villages and towns. Incidents have included damage to homes, agricultural land, and infrastructure, along with direct confrontations between settlers and Palestinians. The spike in violence reflects tensions that have intensified in recent months across the region.",
